  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GFP PROJECT FUNDING OF THIRD ITERATION OF YOUTH FILM MEDIA FILM PRODUCTION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project funding of Third Iteration of Youth Film Media Film Production Programme: Filmi 3&#x2019; for the period from 01 December 2024 to 31st July 2025. G4P have pivoted their focus to system strengthening with the Ministries of Youth, Education, Social Development and Entrepreneurship. Thus providing technical support to change policy, as opposed to direct implementation programming. GFP have a participatory approach to co-design of programmes, based on community needs assessment and then approach donors on this basis.</narrative>
  </description>
